{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-049.md","record_count":9,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s049-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"சேனா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அக்ஷயா! பாதாள சிறையில் கிடக்கும் விஜயா குழந்தை பெற்றிருக்கிறாளாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"சேனா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன அக்ஷயா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒன்றுமில்ல......ஒன்றுமில்ல. அழியப்போகும் நேரத்தில் அரும்பு முளைத்திருக்கிறது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"சேனா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம். அதைத்தான் கிள்ளி எறிய வேண்டும் நீ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! என்ன, நானு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"சேனா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உன்னைவிட யார் இருக்கிறார்கள்—இந்தக் காரியத்தை செய்ய! இந்தா! இப்பொழுதே போ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என் செல்வத்தை நான் கொல்ல வேண்டும்.\nஇல்ல...இல்ல...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"},{"id":"manohara-s049-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s049","scene_ordinal":49,"transition_audit_id":"T049","speaker_label":"மனக்குரல்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா நில். ஆத்திரப்படாதே, அவசரத்திற்கு அடிமையாகாதே! அரண்மனைமுழுதும் எதிரிகள். அன்னையோ சிறையில்-தந்தையோ தவிக்கிறார். வாளை நீட்டிப் பாய்கிறாயே... உன் வாடாமலர்களை யார் காப்பாற்றுவது? உன் வண்ணக் கிளிகளை யார் காப்பாற்றுவது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":76,"printed_page":75}],"source_scene_file":"scene-049.md"}]}